xperia10v-fingerprint
=====================

Unofficial community fingerprint support for the Sony Xperia 10 V
(pdx235 / XQ-DC72) running the Sailfish OS 5.1.0.11 port on a LineageOS 22.2 /
Android 15 vendor base.

