      LGPL-3.0, from the Ubuntu Touch / community fpd project.
  * src/lineage/hardware/sony/biometry/biometry_fp_aidl_for_hybris.cpp
      Apache-2.0 (see the SPDX header).
  * src/sailfish-fpd-community/
      GPL-3.0, modified copy of sailfishos-open/sailfish-fpd-community;
      see src/sailfish-fpd-community/LICENSE.

Not included
------------

Jolla's proprietary `encsfa-fpd` and `libsailfishdevicelock.so.1.2.0` are not
part of this repository or its release artefacts. install.sh installs them on
the phone from the official Jolla packages supplied by the user.

Sony/EgisTec firmware and Android vendor blobs are not part of this repository.

